    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Past is red. And some Knights recalling it. Stories about the most glorious Duels, sharp weapons, and even sharper minds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always looking for wealth, sweet Ladies, and the truth.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/extras/d89380e1f334dd38d7e01f94485396d8.webp?t=1752574268\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Ragdoll-Knights with different Weapons and Armor Sets out of the 15th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a campaign  or local PVP. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to control the physical character and his weird behavior. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Jump and run, dodge, climp, fight)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Combat is dynamic it depends on the weapon choice, the weight of the characters, and their armor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to get through the individual levels alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can heal by drinking wine, which grants a temporary malus on the character stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/extras/5952c843b660f8b8cf4c9ae22f84e158.poster.avif?t=1752574268\" width=746 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/extras/5952c843b660f8b8cf4c9ae22f84e158.webm?t=1752574268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/extras/5952c843b660f8b8cf4c9ae22f84e158.mp4?t=1752574268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Past is red. And some Knights recalling it. Stories about the most glorious Duels, sharp weapons, and even sharper minds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always looking for wealth, sweet Ladies, and the truth.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/extras/d89380e1f334dd38d7e01f94485396d8.webp?t=1752574268\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Ragdoll-Knights with different Weapons and Armor Sets out of the 15th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a campaign  or local PVP. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to control the physical character and his weird behavior. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Jump and run, dodge, climp, fight)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Combat is dynamic it depends on the weapon choice, the weight of the characters, and their armor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to get through the individual levels alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can heal by drinking wine, which grants a temporary malus on the character stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/extras/5952c843b660f8b8cf4c9ae22f84e158.poster.avif?t=1752574268\" width=746 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/extras/5952c843b660f8b8cf4c9ae22f84e158.webm?t=1752574268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/extras/5952c843b660f8b8cf4c9ae22f84e158.mp4?t=1752574268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
